    "Three days that put Kenyan growers, processors and exporters in the same rooms as Chinese buyers, investors and technology providers. Trade on day one, capital and innovation on day two, the expo floor on day three.": "为期三天,让肯尼亚种植者、加工商和出口商与中国买家、投资者和技术提供商齐聚一堂。第一天贸易洽谈,第二天资本与创新,第三天展览会。",
    "Register your interest": "登记意向",
    "Six categories, from delegate to exhibitor. Registration is open as an expression of interest — fees, deadlines and inclusions are set by the secretariat and published here once confirmed.": "六种类别,从代表到参展商。目前开放意向登记——费用、截止日期和具体内容由秘书处制定,确认后将在此公布。",
    "Exhibiting or partnering instead?": "希望参展或合作?",
    "Partnership enquiry": "合作咨询",
    "What is being convened": "峰会内容",
    "A landmark international platform designed to deepen trade, investment, innovation and cultural cooperation between Kenya and China within the tea value chain.": "一个具有里程碑意义的国际平台,旨在深化肯尼亚与中国在茶叶价值链中的贸易、投资、创新和文化合作。",
    "Kenya grows the tea. China drinks more of it than anywhere on earth. Between those two facts sits a chain of buyers, processors, financiers, freight operators and regulators who rarely occupy the same building. For three days in April 2027, they will.": "肯尼亚种植茶叶。中国的茶叶消费量超过地球上任何地方。在这两个事实之间,存在着一条由买家、加工商、金融机构、货运运营商和监管机构组成的链条,他们很少出现在同一栋建筑中。2027年4月,他们将齐聚一堂,为期三天。",
    "<a href=\"/about/\">More about the summit</a>": "<a href=\"/about/\">更多关于峰会的信息</a>",
    "<span class=\"plate__no\">Plate I</span>Kenya&#39;s growing highlands": "<span class=\"plate__no\">第I部分</span>肯尼亚的种植高地",
    "Six objectives": "六大目标",
    "The terms this summit is convened under.": "本次峰会召开的条款。",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Strengthen trade relations</h3>\n          <p>Build durable commercial links between Kenyan tea producers and Chinese buyers.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>加强贸易关系</h3>\n          <p>在肯尼亚茶叶生产商与中国买家之间建立持久的商业联系。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Promote investment</h3>\n          <p>Open Kenya&#39;s tea value chain to Chinese capital across processing, packaging and logistics.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>促进投资</h3>\n          <p>向中国资本开放肯尼亚茶叶价值链,涵盖加工、包装和物流领域。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Support innovation</h3>\n          <p>Bring agricultural technology, processing equipment and traceability tools to the people who will use them.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>支持创新</h3>\n          <p>将农业技术、加工设备和可追溯性工具带给将要使用它们的人们。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Facilitate market access</h3>\n          <p>Shorten the route from a Kenyan estate to a Chinese shelf.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>促进市场准入</h3>\n          <p>缩短从肯尼亚茶园到中国货架的路径。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Foster collaboration</h3>\n          <p>Put producers, policymakers, financiers and researchers in the same rooms for three days.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>促进合作</h3>\n          <p>让生产商、政策制定者、金融机构和研究人员在三天内齐聚一堂。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Promote tea culture</h3>\n          <p>Set Kenya&#39;s tea heritage alongside China&#39;s, as trade and as culture.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>推广茶文化</h3>\n          <p>将肯尼亚的茶叶传统与中国的茶文化并列展示,既是贸易也是文化。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<h2>Three days</h2>\n        <p>Session times, rooms and speakers are added to this manifest as they are confirmed.</p>": "<h2>三天议程</h2>\n        <p>会议时间、会议室和演讲嘉宾将在确认后添加到本日程中。</p>",
    "Opening Ceremony &amp; Trade Forum": "开幕式暨贸易论坛",
    "The summit opens, and the trade conversation starts the same day: who is buying, who is selling, and what stands between them.": "峰会开幕,贸易对话同日开启:谁在采购,谁在销售,以及双方之间存在哪些障碍。",
    "Investment Forum, Innovation Conference &amp; B2B Meetings": "投资论坛、创新大会暨B2B会议",
    "Capital and technology in the morning, structured buyer-supplier meetings through the afternoon.": "上午探讨资本和技术,下午进行结构化买家-供应商会议。",
    "Tea Expo, Cultural Exchange &amp; Closing Ceremony": "茶叶博览会、文化交流暨闭幕式",
    "The exhibition floor opens fully, alongside a cultural programme, before the summit closes.": "展览区全面开放,同时举办文化活动,随后峰会闭幕。",
    "<a href=\"/programme/\">Full programme</a>": "<a href=\"/programme/\">完整议程</a>",
    "The expo floor": "博览会展区",
