    "Stand allocation opens with registration. Structured B2B matchmaking runs through day two, so an exhibitor's meetings are booked before they land.": "展位分配在注册时开放。结构化B2B配对洽谈贯穿第二天全程,因此参展商的会议在抵达前即已预约完成。",
